      "writtenOn": "2023-05-12T10:28:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we merge the two boot images, it would make sense to merge their configs as well. This can be done as a follow-up change, but I think this needs to be done in order to simplify the build system implementation as much as possible (so that it\u0027s back to one image with a single name and intermediate directory for artifacts, meaning that `dex_artjars` is no longer needed).",
