      "writtenOn": "2023-05-12T10:42:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for raising this. We had a long discussion in ART Module team meeting about this. It\u0027ll be very tricky to merge these two configs. Especially, many of our tests assume that there is an \"art\" boot image at \"apex/art_boot_images/javalib\", and they are built on `master-art`, where framework jars don\u0027t exist. Therefore, we need to keep this \"art\" boot image for now, to minimize the amount of changes.\n\nThe changes are targeted for U for a P1 bug, which was raised on 4 May and, unfortunately, the deadline is 12 May (today). To finish the work in time, I chose to go with this approach to minimize the amount of changes.\n\nWe need to clean up the code, but as a follow-up change, not in U.",
